import RoundedGrid from "../assets/RoundedGrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mt-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
    <div class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-white prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-white prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-white prose-blockquote:text-white/70 max-w-none">      
      <h2
        id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-a-Lexington-product-">
        RESULT
      </h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <h3>Seamless Integration and Significant Time Savings:</h3>
          <ul>
          <li>
            <h3>Saved Hours of Manual Work:</h3>
            <p>
The new system significantly reduced the time spent manually managing and reconciling gift card balances across online and in-store platforms. The automation of key tasks saved Birdsnest’s team valuable time, which could now be invested in more strategic efforts.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Operational Efficiency:</h3>
            <p>
The real-time synchronization between BigCommerce and ConnectPOS ensured that all systems were in sync, reducing the potential for errors and improving overall efficiency.
            </p>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Growth in Key Business Metrics:</h3>
          <ul>
          <li>
            <h3>Increased Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR):</h3>
            <p>
By simplifying the gift card process and making it easier for customers to purchase and redeem gift cards, Birdsnest saw a 10% increase in ARR. The unified gift card system encouraged customers to buy more gift cards, particularly for gifting purposes, which boosted sales.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Higher Customer Lifetime Value (LTV):</h3>
            <p>
The ability to track gift cards and follow up with customers on unredeemed balances led to a 15% increase in LTV, as customers returned to redeem their cards and often made additional purchases.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Increased Average Order Value (AOV):</h3>
            <p>
Gift card recipients typically spent more than the value of the card, driving a 12% increase in AOV. Birdsnest’s promotional campaigns that encouraged customers to “add more” to their gift card balance also contributed to this growth.
            </p>
          </li>
          </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
          <h3>Improved Customer Retention and Repeat Purchases:</h3>
            <ul>
          <li>
            <h3>Boost in Repeat Purchases:</h3>
            <p>
Customers who received or purchased gift cards were more likely to return to the store, leading to a 20% increase in repeat purchases. The flexibility of using the gift card both online and in-store played a key role in driving this behavior.
            </p>
          <li>
            <h3>Stronger Customer Engagement:</h3>
            <p>
Personalized follow-ups and reminders about gift card balances, combined with seasonal promotions, led to increased customer engagement and brand loyalty. Birdsnest’s gift card system helped foster stronger connections with customers by offering them a convenient and rewarding shopping experience.
            </p>
          </li>
          </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Fun and Engaging Promotions:</h3>
            <ul>
          <li>
            <h3>Promotional Gift Cards:</h3>
            <p>
Birdsnest launched fun and engaging promotions around their gift cards, such as “buy a gift card, get a bonus,” or seasonal campaigns like holiday-themed gift card offers. These promotions not only increased gift card sales but also brought an element of excitement and fun to the shopping experience.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Customer Rewards:</h3>
            <p>
By integrating the gift card system with their broader loyalty and rewards strategy, Birdsnest was able to further incentivize customers to return and shop more frequently, while enjoying the perks of being loyal customers.
            </p>
          </li>
          </ul>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
        <img alt="Solstice Sunglasses" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="1000" height="532" src="/assets/case-study/TeamBirdsnest.png">
      </div>
</section>

<section class="relative border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
  <div
      class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-white prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-white prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-white prose-blockquote:text-white/70 max-w-none">
<h2>
  CONCLUSION 
</h2>
  <p>By migrating to BigCommerce and integrating a unified gift card system with ConnectPOS, Birdsnest was able to create a seamless omnichannel experience for their customers. The system’s real-time synchronization between in-store and online channels saved hours of manual work, improved operational efficiency, and significantly boosted key metrics such as ARR, LTV, AOV, and repeat purchases. Customers enjoyed the convenience of using gift cards across both platforms, while Birdsnest benefited from increased engagement, higher sales, and more loyal customers. The new system not only streamlined operations but also allowed Birdsnest to reward their best customers and inject some fun into the shopping experience. </p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

